Satisfy + Suffice

Basically, something that "satisfies" the need that you currently have, and is good enough solution wise to "suffice" for the time being.

[[Stewart Brand]] uses this frequently in [[How Buildings Learn]] to explain why and how [[Vernacular]] builders decide to grow, expand, hack, etc. their living spaces and buildings at large.